Group 2 -  Initial Assessment Team (IAT)
 Member 1 (Pediatric Hematologist (Lead)): Specializes in blood disorders in children and oversees the diagnostic workup and initial treatment of potential hematological conditions causing the patient's bleeding and bruising symptoms.
